case recording on nephrite
target nephrite
covers 1-2,4
$ framelog add RAM 0
out 100
Error: No memory space named 'RAM'. Available: M68KBUS, Z80BUS, WRAM, Z80RAM, VRAM, CRAM, VSRAM, ROM
status 1
action none
$ framelog show 1
out 59
No samples recorded for frame log #1 (or it doesn't exist).
status 0
action none
end
